ration-2026-10-07T02-43-01-811948Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-opentelemetry:4.1.1/native-test-verify/pi.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Reconcile the preserved metadata with the earlier successful native-trace result, ensuring subsequent metadata generation does not discard the complete observed registrations.\n2. Run `./gradlew checkMetadataFiles -Pcoordinates=org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-opentelemetry:4.1.1` and `./gradlew test -Pcoordinates=org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-opentelemetry:4.1.1`.\n3. Regenerate the dynamic-access report and metrics after the full test task passes.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a5626a8b82550fd016ac5b42dad1887d1b77df50f0dd86641\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 52403, "output": 2071, "cacheRead": 143744, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1552, "totalTokens": 198218, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791341579704, "responseId": "resp_0a5626a8b82550fd016ac5b40d888487d18ea1e478de526fba", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
